{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: <strong>Shellborne</strong> is currently in the <u><strong>beta</strong> <strong>phase</strong></u>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shellborne</strong> is a student\u2011made, completely <strong>free to play</strong>, co\u2011op adventure\u2014no paywalls, just pure turtle\u2011powered fun. <br><br>If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Collect Resources and Remove Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood, mine stone, and gather berries,  <br>then load them onto your trusty turtle to carry for you. <br>Smash through debris and rebuild bridges to carve out a safe route for your turtle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.poster.avif?t=1771920394\" width=660 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.webm?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.mp4?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The evil fog hunts your turtle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living wall of mist moves toward you, hungry for your magical turtle.  <br>It sends Spirits to slow you down - keep them away and keep running. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Work together and communicate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination is key as you can only carry one tool at a time.<br>Discuss roles and swap gear at the right moment to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The Game is about playing with friends, use the Steam friend list for invites. <br>Use the Steam voice chat or an external tool for communication.  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aww, very first steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/7c6df281d32444223ba4bfd8218e6be200f0028d.jpg"},{"name":"It can walk!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/6047857abd9e178d24f3ddfdd87aeff5ed549de4.jpg"},{"name":"How far can it go?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/8c6d9a094e471c44e33f91ea0b87459c45f9ac6a.jpg"},{"name":"Quite a distance...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/73497312db9d766cf9fc7b16a81c911d3ce9833c.jpg"},{"name":"Now you know how the rabbit runs.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/0f9f3395a20f069c5eb11ae0efa9e87a892c3327.jpg"},{"name":"Wood from Tree.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/5e62f8342ddfd2feaaafd8e1367413650b5930ee.jpg"},{"name":"Get down.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/9761817d5a84ba050bdf5c7ffffb37fdb256c0c1.jpg"},{"name":"More wood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/d9b0fc604c4e2e37b2c1ebbd484b154d6364e23f.jpg"},{"name":"Nature Who?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625950/774ea47604e16febbe87d9da9f7aca6f2e074be7.jpg"},{"name":"Who cares about nature? lol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity